              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 29:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Yowasi abarira abaherezi, at’ Amahera yose azanwa mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, atanzwe mu buryo bg’inyegu, ari yo mahera y’ incungu z’abaharūwe, n’ayo umuntu wese aciriwe, n’ayo umuntu wese azokwiyumvira mu mutima wiwe kuzana mu ngoro y’Uhoraho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayo yose abaherezi bayatware, umuntu wese az’ ayake uwo bazinanyi; mugabo abe ari bo bazosanura iyo ngoro, ah’ igomba gusanwa hose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko kurinda ushitsa mu mwaka ugira mirongwibiri na gatatu umwami Yowasi ari ku ngoma, abo baherezi ntibāribgasanure ah’ iyo ngoro yasambutse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Yowasi ahamagaza umuherezi Yehoyada n’abandi baherezi, arababaza, ati N’iki cababujije gusanura ah’ iyo ngoro yasambutse? None rer’ ayo mahera y’abo muzinanyi mwahora mwaka, ntimwongere kuyatwara, ariko muyatange, kugira ngw asanure ah’ iyo ngoro yasambutse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw abaherezi bemera kubivamwo, no kudasubira kwaka abantu amahera, canke kuba ari bo bazoyisanura ah’ isambutse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
